{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115707","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115707/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115707/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115707/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115707","id":3881815104,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7nX8xA","number":115707,"title":"Wrong string_to_*_chars documentation","user":{"login":"quadrimus","id":155298224,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUGpsA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155298224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus","html_url":"https://github.com/quadrimus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-01T11:00:38Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T09:27:23Z","closed_at":"2026-02-02T09:25:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Still present in 4.6\n\n### System information\n\nnot relevant\n\n### Issue description\n\nReturn value description of function `string_to_utf8_chars` (from `gdextension_interface.h`) says:\n\n> The resulting encoded string length in **_characters_** (not **bytes**), not including a null terminator.\n\nThis is valid for encoding like UTF-16, but UTF-8 is encoding with variable length.\n\nCorrect description should be:\n\n> The resulting encoded string length in **bytes** (not **_characters_**), not including a null terminator.\n\n### Example\n\n| characters | č | a | u | ← 3 characters |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| UTF-8 | 0xC4 0x8D | 0x61 | 0x75 | ← 4 bytes |\n\nFunction `string_to_utf8_chars` returns `4` for string `\"čau\"`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate **GDExtension** using `string_to_utf8_chars` and call it with argument containing Unicode character which is encoded as more than 1 byte (e.g. `'č'`).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee [gdextension_string_to_utf8_chars](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/98782b6c8c9cabe0fb7c80bc62640735ecb076d3/core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp#L973) implementation:\n```C++\n\tCharString cs = self->utf8();\n\tGDExtensionInt len = cs.length();\n```\n\n### Edit\nThe same problem is also for functions:\n- `string_to_latin1_chars`\n- `string_to_utf16_chars`\n- `string_to_utf32_chars`\n- `string_to_wide_chars`\n\nText: `\"čau😀\"`\n```\nencoding=Latin1 length=4 data=20 61 75 20\nencoding=UTF-8  length=8 data=c4 8d 61 75 f0 9f 98 80\nencoding=UTF-16 length=5 data=010d 0061 0075 d83d de00\nencoding=UTF-32 length=4 data=0000010d 00000061 00000075 0001f600\nencoding=Wide   length=5 data=010d 0061 0075 d83d de00\n```\n\n**Note**: Wide is tricky because `wchar_t` is represented as 16-bit on Windows (as UTF-16) and as 32-bit on Linux (as UTF-32). This is also relevant for Godot and function `string_to_wide_chars`, right?","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115707/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}